        "Title": "Pestilent Postmen",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103991729326",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2b64e6b0-8192-4815-9bd9-f3dbc599ac11).Image",
        "Description": "Good day 47,\r\rToday, you have been tasked with `purifying` two disease-bearing deliverymen carrying a rare and dangerous virus known as &quot;Floravore Disease&quot;. \r\rIt is thought to be caused by prolonged exposure to the exotic Mediterranean flower known as the &quot;Vesper Lily&quot;.\r\rThis mission is strictly confidential in order to not spread attention to the possible weaponization of this plant, as such, no one shall find out you were responsible for the purification, or had any association with Sapienza.",
